{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>נדמה</b> — it serves on account of another [word], and likewise <b>נדמה שומרון נדמה מלכה</b> [Samaria is destroyed, her king is swept away]." "<b>כקצף</b> — like <b>ותאנתי לקצפה</b> [and my fig tree is for cursing]."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Reading 'ישרת' as 'תשרת' (it serves/function); the construction is elliptical and rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:48.731683221Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}